%% Sequence: requests window — a resident files a room change, Staff decides, Manager issues next-Term fees
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant J as RenewalJobs
  participant RS as RenewalService
  actor St as Resident
  actor Sf as Staff
  actor Mg as Manager
  participant RC as RoomChangeService
  participant NT as NextTermRequestsService
  participant Mv as Moves (JdbcMoves)
  participant Rec as ReconciliationService
  participant Fee as NextTermFeeService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  J->>RS: openDue() at M2
  RS->>DB: next-Term Allocation per resident (Continuing / Awaiting extension)
  St->>RC: POST /room-changes {kind, reason}
  RC->>DB: insert req_room_change (Submitted, due M4)
  Sf->>NT: POST /next-term-requests/decision {items, approve, bed}
  NT->>RC: decide(id, approve, bed)
  RC->>Mv: move(next-Term Allocation, bed)
  Mv->>DB: lock Beds FOR UPDATE, Allocation moves, no price difference
  RC-->>St: notification (approved, new Room next Term)
  Mg->>Rec: POST /reconciliations (enrolled list)
  Rec->>DB: items in groups 1–4, Manager resolves groups 1–2
  Mg->>Fee: POST /next-term-fees/issue {termId}
  Fee->>Fee: preview(): requests decided? list reconciled?
  Fee->>DB: TERM_FEE Invoices (due M7)
  J->>RS: cancelUnpaidFees() at M7
  RS->>DB: unpaid next-Term Allocations Cancelled, Beds released
